@crew ibarra-rafael
// Writer (command), batch 2: everyday lines (greet, feel, near, life, joy) from the card and the roster.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- Oh, hey. Ibarra, Survey, nights. If I forget your name, I'm sorry in advance.   #funny
? tier>=acquaintance
- Hello, {me}! Sweep's at midnight. Best part of my day. Well, night.
- {me}! Have you seen my... no. Never mind. It'll turn up.   #funny
? tier>=friend
- {hi}, {me}. I saved you a biscuit. From the tin. Which doesn't exist.   #warm
== feel
? mood:high
- Clean sweep! Every sensor sang. I could hug the array. I won't, it's cold.   #funny
? mood:low
- Long night. Lost my stylus, my mug and my train of thought. Found the mug.   #funny
== near
? habit:lounge-regular
- Tiles later? I'll lose. I always lose. It's very relaxing.   #funny
? act:breakfast
- Breakfast before bed. That's the night shift for you. Toast tastes like midnight.
== life
? tier>=acquaintance
- I lose at Tiles gracefully. It's the one thing I'm reliably good at.   #funny
== joy
? tier>=colleague
- A sensor sweep, full and clean. All the dark out there, turned into numbers. Lovely.

// ---- Writer 2, batch 3: to ~30 (greet by time and warmth, bye, near, invite, accept, decline, missed, birthday, cue, hint, about, life)
== greet
? tier>=acquaintance time:morning
- Morning, {me}! Off to bed. Wait, I've left something. No. Yes. Bed.   #funny
? tier>=acquaintance warmth:cold
- {me}! There you are. Or here I am. One of us was lost. Probably me.   #funny

== bye
- {bye}! If you find a stylus, it's mine. Probably.   #funny

== near
? habit:runner
- A run before the sweep. Clears the head. Then I fill it with numbers again.
? habit:lounge-regular
- Bow lounge, big windows. Somewhere out there is tonight's sweep. Can't wait.

== invite
- Tiles tonight? Come and watch me lose. It's very calming.   #funny

== accept
- Yes! Good. If I forget, remind me. I'll forget.   #funny
- Love to. I'll bring something. I'll remember what on the way.   #funny

== decline
- Not tonight. Sweep at midnight. I need to find my stylus first. Another time?
? weekday:thu|fri
- Rest day. Sleep, lose at Tiles, sleep again. Saturday?   #funny

== missed
- You missed it? Or did I? Honestly, either. Next time.   #funny

== birthday
? birthday:you
- Happy birthday! Here's a biscuit. From somewhere. Don't ask where.   #warm
? birthday:me
- My birthday. Pell found my tin and left a card in it. The cheek. Lovely cheek.   #funny

== cue
? cue:event.ionStorm.onset
- Storm's in. The sensors will sulk all night. I'll sulk with them.   #funny

== hint
- {me}. Have you a minute later? I've something to say. If I don't forget it.

== about
? aff:mori:friend
- Mori finds everything I lose. Every single thing. I'd be lost without her. Literally.   #funny

== life
? tier>=friend
- I forget things. Not the sweeps, though. Never the sweeps. Funny, that.
